Subject: [PATCH] docs(supabase): add user_identity migrations 56-58 and
 document them
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Client sign-up (GRA-12) needs somewhere to store the ID/iqama number
and phone. These migrations were applied to the live project on
2026-10-14; the SQL files record them in the repo.

- 56_user_identity: owner-only user_identity table, v_my_identity view,
  complete_client_profile() RPC, purge on account close
- 57: invalid input raises 22023 so the app maps it to ValidationFailure
- 58: v_my_identity runs as security_invoker, like the other v_my_* views

ARCHITECTURE.md §2, §3, §6, §7 and §11 are updated to match.

Refs GRA-12

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
